From 37d6427918e1bf6a644ccfb986fa6e25915db851 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Maxime=20M=C3=A9r=C3=A9?= <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Date: Tue, 16 Apr 2024 11:04:29 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 577/841] feat(fdts): introduce STM32MP21 pinctrl files
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Four packages exist for STM32MP21 dies. As ball-out is different between
them, this patch cover those differences by introducing dedicated
pinctrl dtsi files. Each dtsi pinctrl package file describes the package
ball-out through gpio-ranges.

Available packages are:
STM32MP21xxAL: 10*10 VFBGA361 / 123 GPIOs
STM32MP21xxAM: 14*14 VFBGA289 / 123 GPIOs
STM32MP21xxAN: 11*11 VFBGA273 / 123 GPIOs
STM32MP21xxAO: 8*8 VFBGA225 / 98 GPIOs

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/arm-trusted-firmware.git 29bf6894603aaf82f11f124e6caea83b3cc6481b feat(fdts): introduce STM32MP21 pinctrl files]
Change-Id: Ia2105f5f81fdd93784f7690137484e45a3078d1f
Signed-off-by: Maxime Méré <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/tf-a/+/373899
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Domain-Review: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
---
